OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain, often heavy, edging into
OL,6,Fnorthern England and Wales. Brighter,
OL,7,Fcooler conditions following across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland and much of Scotland.
OL,9,FUnseasonably warm across England and
OL,10,FWales, but largely dry with sunny
OL,11,Fspells. Windy in places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain continuing to move
OL,14,Fsoutheastwards across central and
OL,15,Fsouthern England and Wales, reaching
OL,16,Fthe far southeast later in the night.
OL,17,FClear spells elsewhere, with showers
OL,18,Faffecting the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
