OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain soon clearing the
OL,6,Fsoutheast corner of England;
OL,7,Fotherwise, it's a day of sunny spells
OL,8,Fand showers, these most frequent in
OL,9,Fthe north and west. Temperatures near
OL,10,Fnormal.
